  "question": {
    "text": "A particle which is experiencing a force, given by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>, undergoes a displacement of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>d</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>. If the particle had a kinetic energy of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math> at the beginning&nbsp;of the displacement, what is its kinetic energy at the end of the displacement?<br />&nbsp;",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
