  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Work done by the force,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>F</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi>s</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8901;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math><br /><br />By work energy theorem, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>total</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>K</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>",
